# Singletons and shared services. Every window imports this module by relative
# path, so the service layer stays in one place and cannot be duplicated.
#
# A singleton must be the only instance of its type in the shell: each extra
# instance would register a second notification server or polkit agent.

singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Config 1.0 Config.qml
singleton WallpaperManager 1.0 WallpaperManager.qml
singleton WallpaperLibrary 1.0 WallpaperLibrary.qml
singleton NotificationManager 1.0 NotificationManager.qml
singleton NotificationStore 1.0 NotificationStore.qml
singleton PolkitManager 1.0 PolkitManager.qml
singleton AudioService 1.0 AudioService.qml
singleton MediaService 1.0 MediaService.qml
singleton SystemService 1.0 SystemService.qml
singleton BluetoothService 1.0 BluetoothService.qml
singleton NetworkService 1.0 NetworkService.qml
singleton NightLightService 1.0 NightLightService.qml
singleton IconThemeService 1.0 IconThemeService.qml
singleton IconThemeCatalog 1.0 IconThemeCatalog.qml
singleton NowPlayingService 1.0 NowPlayingService.qml
singleton ClipboardService 1.0 ClipboardService.qml
singleton AppUsage 1.0 AppUsage.qml
singleton AppSearchIndex 1.0 AppSearchIndex.qml
singleton DesktopFileMonitor 1.0 DesktopFileMonitor.qml
singleton OsdService 1.0 OsdService.qml
singleton OverlayService 1.0 OverlayService.qml
singleton BarGlassService 1.0 BarGlassService.qml
